## Concepts Covered

- pvcreate, vgcreate, lvcreate, lvextend, lvreduce, lvremove
- vgextend, vgremove, pvremove
- mkfs.ext4, mkfs.xfs
- resize2fs, xfs_growfs
- mkswap, swapon
- UUID-based /etc/fstab persistent mounts
- blkid, findmnt, lsblk, df

